(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "无聊的课程也结束了，像平时一样走在回家路上。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00126",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "还是老样子，在过人行横道的时候，\n日下还是只对着斑马线的白色部分一跳一跳地蹦着走。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00127",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "就像这样她在我旁边并排走在一起的样子，如今也已经完全习惯了。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00128",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "走了不久，便马上就能看到的十字路口。\n从那里左转就是养老院，直走的话就是日下家。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00129",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "但是，就算不用特别去说也会变成每次都和我一起左转的模式。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00130",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……嗯，虽然每天都过来也没什么问题就是了……",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00131",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "最初，像这样每天都泡在我家里，还想着日下的家人会担心来着。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00132",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "但是前些天顺道去了趟日下家，日下阿姨好像并没有那么在意。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00133",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……不如说，神情非常的开朗并且很高兴。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00134",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "边想着这样的事边走着，突然……",
